+
+Repo: `va-saul/QP-Trucking-Website` · base branch: `main` (at `be17466`, the merge of PR #1)
+
+---
+
+## Step 0 — work out which state you are in
+
+```bash
+cd <repo>
+git log --oneline --all | head -20
+git status --short
+ls src/components/hero/HeroBackdrop.tsx brand/export-brand-assets.mjs 2>&1
+```
+
+| You see | State | Do |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Commits `7a48a91` **and** `43dcb6d` | work is committed | **Case A** |
+| Neither commit, but `src/components/hero/HeroBackdrop.tsx` and `brand/export-brand-assets.mjs` exist | work is on disk, uncommitted | **Case B** |
+| Neither | work did not carry over | **STOP.** Report that the redesign pass 2 changes are absent. Do not invent or redo them. |
+
+Nothing in this work may be squashed, rebased, amended or rewritten — it has
+been reviewed once already.
+
+---
+
+## Case A — commits present
+
+```bash
+git push -u origin arena/01a0b213-qp-trucking-website     # or this session's own branch
+gh pr create --base main --head <branch> \
+  --title "Redesign pass 2: full-bleed heroes, GSAP header + scroll motion, minimalist UI, official logo" \
+  --body-file PULL-REQUEST-BODY.md
+```
+
+## Case B — changes on disk, no commits
+
+Create a branch and commit the working tree, then open the PR from it. Prefer
+this session's own pinned branch; if the work is already sitting on
+`arena/01a0b213-qp-trucking-website`, use that. Stage the whole working tree
+*except* the two handoff files:
+
+```bash
+git add -A -- . ':!HANDOFF.md' ':!PULL-REQUEST-BODY.md'
+git commit -F - <<'MSG'
+Redesign pass 2 + official logo: full-bleed heroes, GSAP header/scroll motion, minimalist UI
